--- a/Documentation/filesystems/proc.rst
+++ b/Documentation/filesystems/proc.rst
@@ -431,6 +431,8 @@ is not associated with a file:
  [stack]                    the stack of the main process
  [vdso]                     the "virtual dynamic shared object",
